%% Figure 2 — Agent Workflow (sequence of interactions)
%% Build in draw.io (Arrange > Insert > Advanced > Mermaid) or mermaid.live,
%% then export PNG/PDF named "fig2_workflow" and place next to main.tex.

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Request
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant T as Technical agent
    participant F as Fundamental agent
    participant N as News agent
    participant A as Aggregator

    U->>O: ticker + risk profile
    Note over O: plan (window, interval)<br/>via structured output

    par Parallel fan-out
        O->>T: plan + data_selection
    and
        O->>F: plan
    and
        O->>N: plan (date window)
    end

    T-->>A: technical score + reasons
    F-->>A: fundamental health
    N-->>A: news sentiment
    Note over A: merge via operator.or_ reducer

    Note over A: renormalized confidence,<br/>veto rules, risk bounds (Python)
    A-->>U: Buy / Wait + entry / TP / SL / hold
